：通过。** 复用率、SoC 参数与性能定位为目标或假设，并绑定 P01/P02/U02 及后续实测，不作为无条件完成事实。\\\\n- **故障恢复：通过（设计）。** ICD 定义串口断开、MCU 超时、传感器故障、服务崩溃/重启、SSE 断线及数据陈旧的检测、降级和恢复行为；未声称已在真实硬件验证。\\\\n\\\\n## 解除阻断所需证据\\\\n\\\\n发布一份决定字段与正文结论一致的 QA 报告；提供合规只读候选快照的容器证据；并提供可核验的独立 QA 与 ARCH 实际会话来源记录及其与报告的绑定。当前两个测试命令通过和架构内容核对不能替代这些正式门禁。\\\\n\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"}}\\nproject-control/docs/evidence/twin/TWIN-01/runs/run_02/reviews/review_eng_dds.md:10:reviewed_artifact_version: \\\"project-control=e9c687584e3d161d68355a0a0a5237e20856712a; test_harness=210ddd1c3f6f59594836c91b68aae55fb7a35181\\\"\\nproject-control/docs/evidence/twin/TWIN-01/runs/run_02/reviews/review_eng_dbus.md:10:reviewed_artifact_version: \\\"project-control=e9c687584e3d161d68355a0a0a5237e20856712a; test_harness=210ddd1c3f6f59594836c91b68aae55fb7a35181\\\"\\nproject-control/docs/evidence/twin/TWIN-01/runs/run_02/arch_server_qa/checkout.log:11:$ git fetch origin 210ddd1c3f6f59594836c91b68aae55fb7a35181 -> 0\\nproject-control/docs/evidence/twin/TWIN-01/runs/run_02/arch_server_qa/checkout.log:13: * branch            210ddd1c3f6f59594836c91b68aae55fb7a35181 -> FETCH_HEAD\\nproject-control/docs/evidence/twin/TWIN-01/runs/run_02/arch_server_qa/checkout.log:14:$ git checkout 210ddd1c3f6f59594836c91b68aae55fb7a35181 -> 0\\nproject-control/docs/planning/coord_autorun_queue_20261029.yaml:26:  - TWIN-18\\nproject-control/docs/evidence/twin/TWIN-01/runs/run_02/reviews/review_eng_th.md:10:reviewed_artifact_version: \\\"project-control=e9c687584e3d161d68355a0a0a5237e20856712a; test_harness=210ddd1c3f6f59594836c91b68aae55fb7a35181\\\"\\nproject-control/docs/planning/vmware_soc_twin_task_execution_20261029.md:47:| [TWIN-18](../../.agents/kanban/microtasks/vmware_soc_twin/TWIN-18.md) | 双MCU运动/调平/断料状态接口调查与协议对账 | ENG-MC | TASK-002 | TWIN-01 | cross-stage |\\nproject-control/docs/evidence/twin/TWIN-01/runs/run_02/arch_server_qa/server_lock.json:12:      \\\"ref\\\": \\\"refs/heads/210ddd1c3f6f59594836c91b68aae55fb7a35181\\\",\\nproje