../../../docs/planning/vmware_soc_twin_task_execution_20261029.md) · [两阶段方案](../../../../docs/planning/vmware_soc_twin_development_plan_20261029.md)\n\n\n## 2026-10-29 独立通信模块与源码维护\n\nENG-DDS长期维护`soc-ap/middleware/dds/`的公开API、真实SDK源码、独立模块CMake、示例及生成接入，并维护`config/dds/twin/`、`tests/dds/twin/`和`third_party/dds/`的来源/准确版本/校验/许可证/补丁/配方。原始上游源码包沿用`third_party/archives/`，不另复制一套。模块代码纳入当前soc-ap仓和服务器候选，不依赖个人安装。\n\n公共`third_party/build.sh`、总校验索引/总README及公共构建由INTEGRATOR按TWIN-04串行修改；本卡只提交自身模块配方/校验与集成请求，不越界修改公共文件。权威IDL/XML由ARCH在TWIN-02维护；业务Owner调用SDK，不私建另一套通信底座。\n\n本次只更新计划/维护入口，尚未实现SDK。验收必须从服务器源码在独立沙箱重建并实际跨进程运行，不能以源码包、库文件或空壳目录存在替代。详见[模块维护规范](../../../../docs/planning/communication_modules_ownership_20261029.md)。\n7a3e344918a5682fe66dedff4914555edeaf93d7 2026-10-30T14:19:02+08:00 docs(twin): record TWIN-05 and TWIN-06 run_01 reviews and run_02 rework results\ne549c9e3c45b34db11e74edfa8cb264cbd5508df 2026-10-30T14:21:26+08:00 docs(twin): record TWIN-05 and TWIN-06 run_02 server_qa and arch_server_qa evidence\n=== Checkout repository 'soc-ap' from ssh://git@192.168.77.113:2222/sushaohua/soc-ap.git ===\n$ git init -> 0\n$ git remote add origin ssh://git@192.168.77.113:2222/sushaohua/soc-ap.git -> 0\n$ git fetch origin 16ba69d29c93191731a13a1fa4c88f981677c4d5 -> 0\nFrom ssh://192.168.77.113:2222/sushaohua/soc-ap\n * branch            16ba69d29c93191731a13a1fa4c88f981677c4d5 -> FETCH_HEAD\n$ git checkout 16ba69d29c93191731a13a1fa4c88f981677c4d5 -> 0\n=== Checkout repository 'test_harness' from ssh://git@192.168.77.113:2222/sushaohua/test_harness.git ===\n$ git init -> 0\n$ git remote add origin ssh://git@192.168.77.113:2222/sushaohua/test_harness.git -> 0\n$ git fetch origin 0b7497ba43158841eb3c4af7f16e477b9c30c2c5 -> 0\nFrom ssh://192.168.77.113:2222/sushaohua/test_harness\n * branch            0b7497ba43158841eb3c4af7f16e477b9c30c2c5 -> FETCH_HEAD\n$ git checkout 0b7497ba43158841eb3c4af7f16e477b9c30c2c5 -> 0\n=== Checkout repository 'project-control' from ssh://git@192.168.77.113:2222/s